	(text "SAFETY-CRITICAL: HEAT ENABLE CHARGE PUMP  (HR-07 / SR-02 / AD-05)\nHEAT_EN must be TOGGLED by the safety task (~5 Hz) to hold the contactor closed.\nA static HIGH level CANNOT hold it -- do not \"simplify\" this to a plain GPIO drive.\nC23=10uF pump, R19=100R limit, D5=BAT54S, C24=3.3uF store, R20=47k bleed + gate pulldown.\nHolds ~2.5 V at Q3 gate; if toggling stops the coil releases in ~0.15 s (NFR-04 allows 1 s)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 181.864 183.388 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7ca3ae12-7d98-418c-b85f-3dd3c7ecdd90")
	)
